Changes made to the model: the weights are rounded to whole numbers of a few bits and written as
brainfuck commands that put them in the program's memory, next to a brainfuck program that runs the
model. The answers can differ slightly from those of the original model. Qwen2.5-Coder-0.5B-Instruct
was first trained further, on brainfuck programs made for this project (compiler/coder/), so that it
answers with a brainfuck program.

